---
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Empower Volleyball Club</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Empower Volleyball Club has concluded operations." />
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/images/logo/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@600&family=Poppins:wght@400&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      body {
        min-height: 100vh;
        background: #fafafa;
        color: #1c1f4c;
        font-family: 'Poppins', system-ui, sans-serif;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }
      main {
        max-width: 640px;
        width: 100%;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .logo {
        display: block;
        max-width: 360px;
        width: 70%;
        height: auto;
        margin: 0 auto 3rem;
        filter: opacity(0.35) saturate(0.55);
      }
      h1 {
        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 1.875rem;
        line-height: 1.3;
        color: #1c1f4c;
        margin: 0 0 2rem;
      }
      p {
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
        color: #1c1f4c;
      }
      p:last-of-type {
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      }
      a.referral {
        color: #1c1f4c;
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
        text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
        font-size: 1rem;
      }
      a.referral:hover {
        text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <img
        class="logo"
        src="/images/logo/empower-logo-horizontal-full-color.svg"
        alt="Empower Volleyball Club"
      />
      <h1>Thank you for the season.</h1>
      <p>
        Empower Volleyball Club has concluded operations. With gratitude to the families
        who took a chance with us — we hope each player carries forward the values we set
        out to build this club around.
      </p>
      <p>
        For families seeking a club that holds to those same values, we recommend
        Adversity Wisconsin Volleyball Club, led by Dave Pauers.
      </p>
      <a class="referral" href="https://www.adversitywisconsin.org">Visit Adversity Wisconsin →</a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
